From: jonathansong <nenghui.song@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] [Flow] Generalize executables that differ only in constants before deduplication

New pass iree-flow-generalize-executables (pipeline flag
--iree-flow-enable-executable-generalization, off by default): within a
group of executables whose dispatch functions are structurally equal up to
the values of index / f32 constants and of static offsets of tensor loads /
stores into globals, every value that differs becomes a dispatch operand, so
DeduplicateExecutables merges the group (e.g. one executable per layer of a
KV cache read at the layer offset becomes one).

